      "value": "@{5f8a26770aaa28611fedd6b6|full_name}: i guess i see tons of worlds available to me but not to my friends and just wonder why there’s not a better effort to make it all cross platform easily.  Not sure how feasible it is in unity (without blender etc) to have a feature that to lower poly count and some of the other factors like graphic quality for skins etc.",
