      "value": "@{6173b32f7b5a4f7cc4e4416f|full_name}: Well, polycount usually isn't the issue. Getting a world *onto* Quest usually isn't the issue, either! It's easy enough to switch a project to Android & upload it to Quest.\nI just think that the people who create worlds usually have access to a PC. And if they do, they'll often not play the Quest version of VRChat.\nPersonally I haven't had much trouble at all getting my worlds onto Quest. But it does take extra effort. Not a lot, but...",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
