      "value": "@{5f8a26770aaa28611fedd6b6|full_name}: ahh interesting thanks for explaining that! And also thanks for being one of those people who make cross platform worlds :)\nHmm so guess maybe I can wish that vrchat would some kind of incentive to encourage world creators to go back and republish for occulus support. For example, a contest for cross platform worlds and the prize is for I dunno 3-6 months of the plus membership or something.",
