      "value": "@{5f8a26770aaa28611fedd6b6|full_name}: ah yes! I see that the cross platform isn’t a mandatory submission requirement is the thing, if it was more mandatory then it would enable that better but at the same time, I can see that the pc developers who don’t have an occulus don’t have means to test their world to see in a environment with occulus like performance. \nOr like another contest which is specific to updating existing worlds to cross platform would be nice. \nOoh yah would you okay to share a world you worked on so my friends and I can check it out :) thank you!",
