  "details": "As a VR player on vive, I have to opt for worlds that work for the oculus because it seems most VR players are on oculus. That goes for my friends. I would like to hang out with friends better so wish to ask that there’s easier cross platform conversion tools in unity to help with this so more worlds can be cross platform.",
